        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: Skyplex, Skyscraper\n- Places: Orlando, Florida\n- Products: Perkins Restaurant and Bakery\n- Concepts: world records\n\nFacts:\n- Skyplex is a planned complex in Orlando, Florida.\n- Skyplex will include a 570 ft tower.\n- Skyplex's tower will feature Skyscraper, a roller coaster.\n- Skyscraper is an upcoming roller coaster planned for the Skyplex complex in Orlando, Florida.\n- Upon completion, Skyscraper will become the tallest roller coaster in the world at over 500 ft.\n- Upon completion, Skyscraper will also feature the world's steepest drop and highest inversion.\n- Skyplex will also include the world's largest Perkins Restaurant and Bakery.",
